<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About | Alumni Connect</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Learn about the Alumni Connect complete system and how it works.">
    <link rel="icon" href="/logo.png" type="image/png">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
      tailwind.config = {
        theme: {
          extend: {
            colors: {
              linkedin: '#0a66c2',
              discord: '#5865F2',
              pageBg: '#f3f2ef',
              cardBorder: '#e0dfdc',
              textPrimary: '#191919',
              textSecondary: '#666666'
            }
          }
        }
      }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-pageBg text-textPrimary min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center font-sans antialiased p-4">
    <div class="bg-white max-w-2xl w-full rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-cardBorder">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6 space-x-4 items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full shadow-sm overflow-hidden bg-white border border-gray-200">
                <img src="/logo.png" alt="TCET Logo" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
            </div>
            <div class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-gray-300"></div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-linkedin flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/></svg>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-6 text-textPrimary">About the System</h1>
        
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-linkedin">How It Works & Usage</h2>
            <p class="text-textSecondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
                The Alumni Connect Bot seamlessly links our Discord community with verified LinkedIn professionals.
                By connecting your account, you get access to an exclusive alumni network, directory, and job board right inside Discord. Our fully automated system verifies credentials, manages role distribution based on your LinkedIn seniority, and securely maintains an internal directory of professionals to build an empowering community.
            </p>
            <p class="text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
                <strong>Usage:</strong> It's simple! Start by running <code class="bg-blue-50 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-linkedin">/connect-linkedin</code> to authenticate. Once verified, you unlock access to premium commands to post jobs, find seniors or juniors, and expand your professional network seamlessly from any text channel.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-linkedin">Features & Community</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-medium text-textPrimary mb-1">Exclusive Job Board</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
                        Say goodbye to standard job boards. Discover hidden opportunities, referrals, and roles directly posted by verified alumni in our community. Access real openings with transparent details.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-medium text-textPrimary mb-1">Targeted Networking</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
                        Find mentors or mentees based on specific fields, companies, or experience levels. Filter the directory to connect with exactly the right people to accelerate your career.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-medium text-textPrimary mb-1">Automated Verification</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
                        Every member's background is authenticated through LinkedIn's OAuth system. We ensure our community remains trusted, professional, and free of impersonators or spam.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-medium text-textPrimary mb-1">Privacy First</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
                        You're in control of your data. Opt-in to make your profile visible to the directory, or choose to remain completely private while still retaining access to jobs and resources.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-linkedin">Key Commands</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/connect-linkedin</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">Securely connect your LinkedIn profile</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/profile</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">View or manage your connected profile</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/browse-jobs</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">Explore active job postings from alumni</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/post-job</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">Share a new job or referral opportunity</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/find-seniors</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">Search and connect with senior alumni</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/leaderboard</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">See top community contributors</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/browse-directory</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">Search the entire alumni professional directory</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/my-postings</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">Manage the jobs and referrals you posted</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-pageBg p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                    <code class="text-linkedin font-bold block mb-1">/disconnect</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">Safely unlink and remove your LinkedIn data</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 space-x-6">
            <a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-textSecondary hover:text-linkedin transition-colors">Home</a>
            <a href="/privacy" class="text-sm font-semibold text-textSecondary hover:text-linkedin transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
